DCP I8 local packaged laboratory integration

This repository records and applies a local integration to Agent Orchestrator,
Copyright 2026 Untrivial, licensed under the Apache License 2.0. The exact
upstream license is preserved in third_party/agent-orchestrator/LICENSE.

The official upstream source is fetched outside Git at the release pinned in
upstream/agent-orchestrator.lock. DCP modifies packaged product identity,
namespace, lifecycle gateway, worker isolation and release gates through the
exact patch in patches/agent-orchestrator/, with every changed file and test
visible there. Repository-owned build/install/gateway scripts and the curator
adapter are separate DCP-authored integration code.

No upstream binary is committed or distributed by this repository. The local
user-owned artifact is named DCP Orchestrator and identifies the pinned Agent
Orchestrator foundation in its bundle metadata. Apache-2.0 does not grant
trademark rights.
